; Tauri CLI 2.10.1 custom-message keys, plus FlashRun's MUI page copy.
LangString addOrReinstall ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "修复或重新安装"
LangString alreadyInstalled ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "已安装 FlashRun"
LangString alreadyInstalledLong ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "已安装 ${PRODUCTNAME} ${VERSION}。请选择操作，然后点击“下一步”。"
LangString appRunning ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "FlashRun 正在运行。请保存工作并关闭程序后继续。"
LangString appRunningOkKill ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "FlashRun 正在运行。$\r$\n请先保存工作。点击“确定”将终止 FlashRun，点击“取消”返回。"
LangString chooseMaintenanceOption ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "请选择如何处理现有安装。"
LangString choowHowToInstall ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "请选择可以使用 ${PRODUCTNAME} 的用户。"
LangString createDesktop ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "创建 FlashRun 桌面快捷方式"
LangString dontUninstall ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "保留现有安装"
LangString dontUninstallDowngrade ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "保留现有安装（降级前需要先卸载）"
LangString failedToKillApp ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法终止 FlashRun。请手动关闭程序后重试。"
LangString installingWebview2 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "正在安装 Microsoft Edge WebView2 运行时…"
LangString newerVersionInstalled ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "已安装较新版本的 ${PRODUCTNAME}，不建议安装旧版本。如需继续，建议先卸载当前版本。"
LangString older ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "较旧"
LangString olderOrUnknownVersionInstalled ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "检测到 ${PRODUCTNAME} 的$R4版本。请选择是否先卸载现有版本，然后点击“下一步”。"
LangString silentDowngrades ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "此安装程序不允许静默降级。请打开安装向导查看可用操作。$\r$\n"
LangString unableToUninstall ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法卸载现有版本。"
LangString uninstallApp ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "卸载 ${PRODUCTNAME}"
LangString uninstallBeforeInstalling ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "先卸载现有版本"
LangString unknown ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "未知"
LangString webview2AbortError ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法安装 Microsoft Edge WebView2 运行时。FlashRun 需要它来显示界面，请检查网络连接后重试。"
LangString webview2DownloadError ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "WebView2 下载失败。详细信息：$0"
LangString webview2DownloadSuccess ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "WebView2 安装程序已下载。"
LangString webview2Downloading ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "正在下载 Microsoft Edge WebView2 运行时…"
LangString webview2InstallError ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "WebView2 安装失败。退出代码：$1"
LangString webview2InstallSuccess ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "WebView2 运行时已就绪。"
LangString deleteAppData ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "删除本地网页数据（保留项目配置）"
LangString FlashRunWelcomeTitle ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "欢迎安装 FlashRun"
LangString FlashRunWelcomeText ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "在一个工作台中管理项目、运行命令和查看终端。$\r$\n$\r$\n本向导将为你安装 FlashRun。继续之前，请先关闭正在运行的 FlashRun。$\r$\n$\r$\n点击“下一步”选择安装位置。"
LangString FlashRunFinishTitle ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "FlashRun 已准备就绪"
LangString FlashRunFinishText ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "安装已完成。$\r$\n$\r$\n打开 FlashRun，添加项目文件夹，即可选择并运行项目命令。$\r$\n$\r$\n点击“完成”关闭安装向导。"
LangString FlashRunLaunch ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "打开 FlashRun"
